  18 DA 630, 634
  19 Ev 631; 2T 320, 424
  20 GC 26; 5T 451, 464
  20, 21 GC 30; PP 166
  20–22 DA 630
  25 GC 37, 304
  25, 26 Ev 18; 1T 268
  26 EW 41; 4T 53
  28 DA 632; Ev 18; GC 308; LS 272
  30, 31 GC 308
  31 DA 234, 634
  33–36  9T 268
  34 COL 55, 319; DA 234, 636; GC 309, 626; TM 238; 1T 168, 469; 2T 283; 4T 31, 309; 5T 152,  235,  259,  280, 461; 6T 410
